# Talking to a resident or a wanderer (week 30).
# Everything in {{ }} and every "do ..." / "[if ... /]" comes from the
# conversation's Talk object (src/dialogue/talk.gd): the words that depend on
# the world are made there, the shape of the conversation is here.

~ start
{{npc}}: {{greeting}}
if hostile
	=> END
=> menu

~ menu
- What news?
	{{npc}}: {{rumor()}}
	=> menu
- Tell me about your people.
	{{npc}}: {{creed}}
	=> menu
- Trade? [if can_trade /]
	{{npc}}: {{offer_text}}
	if has_payment
		- Deal.
			do trade()
			{{npc}}: {{trade_done_text}}
		- Not now.
	=> menu
- Farewell.
	{{npc}}: {{farewell}}
	=> END
